INPUT_PARAMETERS
suffix               efield_reference
calculation          scf
basis_type           pw
gamma_only           1
nspin                1
nbands               8
ecutwfc              40
ecutrho              160
scf_thr              1.0e-7
scf_nmax             60
symmetry             0
pseudo_dir           ../../../tests/PP_ORB
orbital_dir          ../../../tests/PP_ORB
nelec                10
smearing_method      gaussian
smearing_sigma       0.002
mixing_type          broyden
mixing_beta          0.4
device               cpu

# External saw electric field.  For this cubic cell (LATTICE_VECTORS diag(15))
# the fixed-mu constraint with mu = -0.01 Ry corresponds to
#     efield_amp = -mu / 2 = +0.005  (Hartree)
# (see README.md).  Keep efield_pos_max/efield_pos_dec equal to the constraint
# saw_pos/saw_pos_dec so the two potentials have the same shape.
efield_flag          1
efield_dir           2
efield_pos_max       0.9
efield_pos_dec       0.1
efield_amp           0.005
dip_cor_flag         0
